      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "> This change does not prevent using `exportwatchonlywallet no_dat_extension` RPC and subsequently opening the file in the GUI.\r\n\r\nNow it does :)\r\n\r\nSecond commit allows to load a non `.dat` file. Force file type filtering might cause the issue reported in https://github.com/bitcoin-core/gui/issues/956, thus breaking UX.\r\n\r\nStill I think the first commit is good as adding the file extension is normally good expected behavior and is what the GUI already does with backup wallet.",
